  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Read problem statements in Vietnamese,Find KKK distinct numbers in the range [1,N][1, N][1,N] such that the bitwise XOR of all the numbers is maximized. Print **any** set of these numbers that maximize the XOR.\n\n###Input\n\n\nThe first line contains an integer TTT, the number of test cases. Then the test cases follow.\nEach test case contains a single line of input, two integers NNN, KKK.\n###Output\r\nFor each test case, output KKK distinct integers in any order as described in the problem.\n\n###Constraints\n\n\n1≤T≤1041 \\leq T \\leq 10^41≤T≤104\n1≤K≤N≤1061 \\leq K \\leq N \\leq 10^61≤K≤N≤106\nThe sum of NNN over all queries is at most 4⋅1064\\cdot 10^64⋅106.\nThe sum of KKK over all queries is at most 2⋅1062\\cdot 10^62⋅106.\n###Subtasks\r\n**Subtask #1 (5 points):**\n\n\n1≤T≤501 \\leq T \\leq 501≤T≤50\n1≤K≤N≤201 \\leq K \\leq N \\leq 201≤K≤N≤20\n**Subtask #2 (20 points):**\n\n\n1≤T≤501 \\leq T \\leq 501≤T≤50\n1≤K≤N≤2001 \\leq K \\leq N \\leq 2001≤K≤N≤200\nThe sum of NNN over all queries is at most 800800800.\nThe sum of KKK over all queries is at most 400400400.",
    "constraints": [
      "###Sample Input",
      "`3",
      "10 1",
      "9 2",
      "8 7",
      "`###Sample Output",
      "`10",
      "7 8",
      "1 2 3 4 5 6 8",
      "`###Explanation",
      "**Test Case 111:** The only possible set is {10}\\{10\\}{10} which gives the value 101010.",
      "**Test Case 222:** The other possible set is {9,6}\\{9, 6\\}{9,6} which gives the value 9⊕6=15=7⊕89 \\oplus 6 = 15 = 7 \\oplus 89⊕6=15=7⊕8.",
      "**Test Case 333:** The only possible set is {1,2,3,4,5,6,8}\\{1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8\\}{1,2,3,4,5,6,8} which gives the value 1⊕2⊕3⊕4⊕5⊕6⊕8=151 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 3 \\oplus 4 \\oplus 5 \\oplus 6 \\oplus 8 = 151⊕2⊕3⊕4⊕5⊕6⊕8=15."
    ],
